    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667370/extras/1975432f13f6183f18c21b348744df1b.avif?t=1752167083\" width=250 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Object of Love&quot; </strong>is a <strong>slice-of-life BL visual novel</strong> about the mysterious charm of \u00a0faceless characters known as <strong>object-heads.\u00a0</strong>Did the likes of Chairface from <i>The Tick</i>, Prince IV from <i>Saga</i> or Camera Man from <i>No More Movie Thief </i>ever make your heart flutter? Then it's the perfect game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where things that have strong emotions poured into them occasionally come to life and become humanoid creatures known as <strong>object-heads,</strong> a down-on-his-luck young man goes to ask his sister for a place to stay while he gets back on his feet... only to be told that she passed away not long ago, and that the bar she managed will have to close soon if they can't find someone willing to fill the now vacant position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With little to no knowledge about the service industry, but having run out of options, he accepts. Will it turn out to be the opportunity he needed, or will it lead to disaster? Only one way to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667370/extras/7de96484a401db0e1b996bf097281dab.avif?t=1752167083\" width=250 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u8d85\u8fc7 50,000 \u5b57\u7684\u5267\u672c\u5185\u5bb9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 \u4f4d\u53ef\u653b\u7565\u89d2\u8272</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u652f\u6301\u897f\u73ed\u7259\u8bed\u4e0e\u82f1\u8bed\u7248\u672c</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 \u5f20\u539f\u521b\u80cc\u666f\u56fe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 \u5f20\u63d2\u56fe/CG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u539f\u521b\u97f3\u4e50\u539f\u58f0\u5e26\uff08OST\uff09</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667370/extras/1975432f13f6183f18c21b348744df1b.avif?t=1752167083\" width=250 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Object of Love&quot; </strong>is a <strong>slice-of-life BL visual novel</strong> about the mysterious charm of \u00a0faceless characters known as <strong>object-heads.\u00a0</strong>Did the likes of Chairface from <i>The Tick</i>, Prince IV from <i>Saga</i> or Camera Man from <i>No More Movie Thief </i>ever make your heart flutter? Then it's the perfect game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where things that have strong emotions poured into them occasionally come to life and become humanoid creatures known as <strong>object-heads,</strong> a down-on-his-luck young man goes to ask his sister for a place to stay while he gets back on his feet... only to be told that she passed away not long ago, and that the bar she managed will have to close soon if they can't find someone willing to fill the now vacant position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With little to no knowledge about the service industry, but having run out of options, he accepts. Will it turn out to be the opportunity he needed, or will it lead to disaster? Only one way to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667370/extras/7de96484a401db0e1b996bf097281dab.avif?t=1752167083\" width=250 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u8d85\u8fc7 50,000 \u5b57\u7684\u5267\u672c\u5185\u5bb9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 \u4f4d\u53ef\u653b\u7565\u89d2\u8272</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u652f\u6301\u897f\u73ed\u7259\u8bed\u4e0e\u82f1\u8bed\u7248\u672c</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 \u5f20\u539f\u521b\u80cc\u666f\u56fe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 \u5f20\u63d2\u56fe/CG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u539f\u521b\u97f3\u4e50\u539f\u58f0\u5e26\uff08OST\uff09</p></li></ul>",
